Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Pineapple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:06.37,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.37,0:01:08.54,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.32,0:01:13.13,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,18 episode
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.74,0:01:15.81,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:17.71,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.01,0:01:25.08,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.72,0:01:30.79,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Stop! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:38.13,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:49.81,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Did the king come to me while I was sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.41,0:01:51.68,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.48,0:01:53.71,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,It was not a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.68,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,But why does he behave this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.68,0:01:57.95,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,As if someone is chasing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.28,0:02:01.42,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Donghak are becoming more and more influential.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.12,0:02:04.86,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I understand, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:06.99,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.36,0:02:10.13,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,That's right, the king will return very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:12.26,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.23,0:02:15.50,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,There must be a reason why he left so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:19.44,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Make sure everything is okay,\Nand come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:22.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Of course, it’s better to go quickly than to wait until I come to say goodbye to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.57,0:02:25.44,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,That's why he left without warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.59,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,This throne now has a new owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.09,0:02:43.49,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,You could figure it out right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.86,0:02:46.66,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,All because the queen made the right choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:50.10,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:52.20,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,For the sake of your child
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.20,0:02:54.74,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,she sided with the family, not the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.71,0:02:58.24,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,If so, then for the sake of the heir to the throne
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:02.35,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I will close my eyes to the queen’s sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.98,0:03:09.02,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you don't have to worry about fighting for the throne anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.55,0:05:23.09,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:10.40,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I want more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:14.37,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Don’t you eat a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.91,0:06:17.07,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,A person gets used to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:19.28,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,The food used to be tasteless,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:20.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,but now I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.45,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,No matter how much we eat, we just can’t get enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:24.11,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,On the contrary, hunger is only getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.88,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,The Little Prince is a glutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.26,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Okay. I won't do it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.26,0:06:40.70,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Everything is fine with me.\NWhy are you looking like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.70,0:06:44.77,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,You need to take a walk.\NIt's good for digestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:47.17,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,But first I’ll finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:02.55,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,The weather is just terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.69,0:07:07.46,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I would like to take a picture and put it in a frame and hang it on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:11.29,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,It’s not too late to resolve
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:13.23,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,all misunderstandings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:15.87,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Let's live the way you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.80,0:07:18.87,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Social distancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.27,0:07:22.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,You are my real anti-fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:27.48,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I was worried, but now I found a way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:28.91,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,So don’t love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.91,0:07:30.78,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,But I still love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:33.85,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,And I will love, let you have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.62,0:07:36.12,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,all the shortcomings of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.19,0:07:39.72,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I can’t help but think about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.96,0:07:41.56,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Terrible place! Let's leave quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:42.59,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:47.46,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Barely made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:50.20,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Not a lake, but an abyss of memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:05.25,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Then today is our first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:07.28,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I propose an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:11.76,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:17.13,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,No social distancing from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:27.90,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:31.37,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Yes, this whole palace is one continuous memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.55,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Why are there so few people?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:38.25,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,How long has the palace been so big?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:49.95,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Memories Strike Back
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:54.26,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:04.74,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,\Nthe Minister of War has come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:09.28,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I did not find you in your chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:14.28,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Did something happen to the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.68,0:09:15.75,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.96,0:09:23.26,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,You're bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.73,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Hurt yourself somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:30.53,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Just a small injury\Nafter training.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.84,0:09:34.77,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I know it’s late,\Nbut I came to congratulate you on your pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.64,0:09:37.84,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:41.34,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Don’t think about rejoining the clan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:44.05,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,for the well-being of your child?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.35,0:09:47.22,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I thought we discussed everything last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.65,0:09:49.79,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I don’t care that you abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.72,0:09:52.86,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I still won’t leave you completely without help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.09,0:09:54.32,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,You and yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:57.99,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,you know that you can’t cope alone in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:02.90,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Thank you for the advice, but I’m not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:05.27,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,And you know this very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:08.44,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,If you need help,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.44,0:10:10.31,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I am always ready to lend my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.57,0:10:12.48,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,For you and your child
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:15.45,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:31.83,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Recently\Npopular indignation has increased.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.23,0:10:35.13,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,News reaches me about the peasant uprising,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.63,0:10:39.27,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I intend to personally\Ninvestigate the situation in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.04,0:10:43.27,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Everything connected with the people is important,\Nand while I’m not here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.07,0:10:46.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,you must obey\Nthe orders of the Queen Dowager.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:50.45,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,This is the decree of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.45,0:10:59.69,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Since I am now replacing the king in office, I will replace several officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.92,0:11:02.19,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,to properly carry out his order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:03.93,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Kim Seokkeun will return
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:05.43,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,to your post,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:07.66,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,and former Minister of War Kim Changhyup
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:09.57,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,will take the place of the head of the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.03,0:11:12.20,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong, who holds this post,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.20,0:11:15.31,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,focus\Non his duties as the head of Ijeongcheon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:40.43,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,The king has embarked on a difficult path.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.26,0:11:45.07,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,If even one tries\Nto tarnish his reputation,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.70,0:11:49.61,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,this person should\Nfear for the safety of his language.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.21,0:12:25.38,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:27.74,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,you're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:31.95,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,In this life
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.25,0:12:33.65,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,do not deny yourself anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:44.53,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,A handwritten letter is just the thing\Nto calm a rebellious heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:52.97,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Baby, do you miss daddy too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.24,0:12:55.07,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Say: “Dad, come back soon!”
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Is it really kicking? Is this how you answer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.71,0:13:02.51,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Isn’t the fruit moving too early?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.51,0:13:03.71,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Very early.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:07.08,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Is the child a genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:10.32,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Oh my God! I will give birth to a genius!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.26,0:13:14.72,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,And why am I so happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.06,0:13:21.10,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.93,0:13:25.50,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Something tells me\Nthat this will be a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:27.60,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I'll be a terrible parent,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:30.37,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,a terrible cross between a loving father and a crazy mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:32.34,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Your child is precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:34.21,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,There is never too much care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.51,0:13:38.18,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I'm sure the baby will be exactly like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.88,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,What kind of horrors are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:42.22,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.02,0:13:46.82,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Why, if my child is like me, is it terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:49.29,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Time to take your medicine, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:58.47,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,To the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:00.80,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:03.71,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Her Majesty called the child hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:09.78,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.89,0:14:21.99,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,And what did they mix in their decoctions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.29,0:14:26.63,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,This medicine is definitely against miscarriage,\Nand not for dementia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:32.34,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Horror! What kind of mental attack is this?\NWhy do I keep thinking about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:36.54,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Everything in the palace reminds of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:56.06,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Our king is Cheoljong,\Nhere I am embroidering CJ.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:59.00,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Did you really embroider this in just one night?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.16,0:15:01.16,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,It was always interesting\Nwhat everyone finds in embroidery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.16,0:15:03.40,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,While my hands are busy, my head is empty of thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:04.47,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:06.84,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,You are a real craftswoman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.20,0:15:08.71,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.71,0:15:11.07,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,This is silk from Jinju, Gyeongsangnam-do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:12.81,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I thought, on windy days
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.64,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,the best thing to wear is such a scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.98,0:15:17.85,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I'm sure His Majesty\Nwill like your gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:21.15,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Here’s another scarf for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.22,0:15:24.52,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,All the muscles are stiff from sitting for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.66,0:15:27.92,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Would you like to play something fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.49,0:15:29.89,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,-Of course, Your Majesty!\N-Of course, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:32.13,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.23,0:15:38.67,Default,pineapple 1,0,0,0,,I know! King!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.14,0:15:43.41,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.87,0:15:44.91,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Chief Eunuch?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.58,0:15:48.11,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Well, yes, there is a chief eunuch who serves the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:50.78,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Yes, this is the answer - the chief eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:56.39,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,So, that means? Didn't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.09,0:15:58.09,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:00.69,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.69,0:16:01.72,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,King!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.72,0:16:02.79,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:03.79,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:04.96,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.96,0:16:06.00,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.23,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.23,0:16:13.30,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,This is quite easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:15.41,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Whines like an abandoned puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:16.94,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,King?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.88,0:16:19.91,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:23.51,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Do you miss him that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.71,0:16:26.78,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,High relationships.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.42,0:16:31.62,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Nothing like that. Don't exaggerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.89,0:16:32.96,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Lord, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.52,0:16:36.13,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Somehow it’s not fun. Give me a needle and thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:44.23,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Queen, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.87,0:16:45.87,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.87,0:16:49.14,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.01,0:16:51.61,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,This is so painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.01,0:16:55.41,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,How can a thin needle hurt so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.51,0:17:00.42,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,All because of hormones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.25,0:17:02.35,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Because of pregnancy
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.35,0:17:04.62,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I get upset easily. And I have a lot of worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:06.42,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,So I’m constantly roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:09.59,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,It’s not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.43,0:17:11.96,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,These are hormones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.56,0:17:18.30,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,My heart hurts so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.30,0:17:25.44,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,As if a needle had pricked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.88,0:17:27.01,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.11,0:17:33.15,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.82,0:17:36.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.62,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,We are still looking for the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:43.59,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Please give me more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.79,0:17:45.03,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I can’t wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.10,0:17:49.40,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,All the more reason to hurry,\Nin case the king is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:53.00,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,I will announce the fate that befell the king. Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:17:55.57,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:00.04,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.44,0:18:02.31,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Some needle will no longer make me cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.11,0:18:05.21,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.95,0:18:07.65,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-That scared me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:09.35,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I almost had a miscarriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:11.25,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Can you say such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:15.16,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.89,0:18:18.26,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What's the matter? You're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.07,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Has the king suffered?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.54,0:18:27.27,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,His Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.37,0:18:31.81,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,King
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.28,0:18:35.98,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,left this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.03,0:18:57.20,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And if I hadn’t fallen asleep that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.34,0:19:00.44,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,King
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.01,0:19:05.07,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,left this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:16.42,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,What if I asked you to stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.89,0:19:21.12,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, come back to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.33,0:19:25.93,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, come back to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.13,0:19:31.67,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, come back to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.57,0:19:35.77,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,If I had never gotten to Joseon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.14,0:19:38.91,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,and we wouldn’t have met?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.28,0:19:43.28,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You would still be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.28,0:19:46.58,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,5 days before ascending the throne
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:48.18,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Return?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:50.52,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Is it possible to ask a dead person to return?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.52,0:19:52.99,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What a terrible request.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.42,0:19:55.66,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And the body has not yet been found.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:19:58.49,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The cry asking me to come back makes my hair stand on end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.10,0:20:02.23,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,If I could, I would crown a new king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.23,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,But if I don’t follow traditions
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.23,0:20:06.14,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and wait for the resurrection of the deceased king,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:09.44,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I’m sure this will backfire on me and ruin all my political plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.44,0:20:11.47,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Even if the king is alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:13.94,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,he will not be able to return to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.41,0:20:16.95,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I closed all the gates
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.95,0:20:18.65,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,until the new coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:20.28,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.62,0:20:23.45,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,If in five days we can hold a coronation,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.49,0:20:26.16,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,he will no longer be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.59,0:20:28.49,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,So, if we kill him, it will no longer be treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.87,0:20:38.40,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,How long do I have to wait until the queen comes to her senses?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.87,0:20:42.64,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Doesn’t she really want to reunite with the clan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.64,0:20:45.51,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I'll tell her to get ready and pay you a visit
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.51,0:20:46.98,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,asap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.70,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Pregnancy Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:17.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,And why is this needed now,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.28,0:21:21.54,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,when you’re not here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:47.97,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Power is bought with money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.95,0:21:57.98,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,My child.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:22:01.08,Default,Spillit2,0,0,0,,Don’t be sensitive to the smell of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:03.32,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Don’t complicate the life of your beautiful mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:07.16,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Hush as much as you want during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.49,0:22:11.09,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,But when your mommy wants to sleep, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.80,0:22:14.56,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,When the time comes to go out into the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.56,0:22:16.83,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,come out quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:19.10,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,don’t make your mommy suffer too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:24.47,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The most important thing is to come into the world healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.08,0:22:31.98,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I’m really looking forward to the day when we meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.92,0:22:41.02,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I promise to be by your side,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.02,0:22:43.16,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,when you take your first breath in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.79,0:22:47.76,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Even if the world seems strange to you, do not be afraid of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.32,0:23:34.98,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Show respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:38.32,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,So this was your plan initially?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.89,0:23:42.23,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,The king knew about the danger that threatened him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.83,0:23:44.83,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,But for the sake of your salvation
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.83,0:23:46.73,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,risked his life and left the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.06,0:23:49.40,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.01,0:23:59.78,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Put Prince Yeonpyeong in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:02.88,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,-No!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.15,0:24:04.88,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.02,0:24:09.55,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Why are you taking your anger out on the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.55,0:24:12.69,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,The king left the world because of Tonhak's followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.06,0:24:20.06,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,The rebels didn’t even touch the governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.96,0:24:23.77,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,You say they dared to kill the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.93,0:24:27.24,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Do you think I will believe such a pathetic lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.24,0:24:32.44,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Kim Byonin, your warriors killed the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.84,0:24:38.18,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You and the queen doomed him to death,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:41.48,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,so I personally must take her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.02,0:24:46.22,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.52,0:24:47.66,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.56,0:24:50.73,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,For the sake of the child in her belly,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.63,0:24:53.86,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,please don’t harm her.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.70,0:24:57.20,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Her Majesty knew nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.63,0:24:58.80,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.04,0:25:02.54,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,I beg you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.55,0:25:14.55,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Lord! Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.89,0:25:22.19,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Take him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.64,0:25:39.21,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.05,0:25:44.58,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,What was he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.31,0:25:47.48,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Your soldiers killed the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.09,0:25:50.45,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You two, leave the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.89,0:25:54.36,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.60,0:26:10.51,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,Someone must be blamed for the misfortune that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.68,0:26:14.68,Default,Spillie2,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong was delirious,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.31,0:26:17.15,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,don’t take this to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.38,0:26:20.78,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Why was Prince Yeonpyeong sent to prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.05,0:26:23.02,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I have evidence that he let go
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.02,0:26:24.79,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,followers of Tonhak, sneaking in
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.92,0:26:27.79,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,to the royal guard, and helped them escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.99,0:26:30.53,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,It seems that they are connected with the incident that happened with the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.53,0:26:32.56,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,because I was going to interrogate Prince Yeonpyeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.76,0:26:35.23,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,I should have done this earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.80,0:26:37.67,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,What exactly are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.20,0:26:40.60,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,You speak as if Prince Yeonpyeong killed the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.60,0:26:43.47,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Someone in the palace must have handed over to Tonhak's followers
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.47,0:26:46.48,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,information about when the king will leave the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.64,0:26:51.01,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,It should be someone who has access to information,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.71,0:26:53.78,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,which means this is most likely Prince Yeonpyeong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.72,0:26:57.99,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,Are you sure that it was Tonhak’s followers who attacked the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.25,0:27:01.76,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,You must focus on what is more important.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.46,0:27:06.06,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,Now only your clan can protect you
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.06,0:27:07.43,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,and your child.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.30,0:27:10.60,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,It’s no use worrying about anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.63,0:27:13.34,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,First you must make peace with the dowager queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.00,0:27:15.24,Default,Spilyk2,0,0,0,,If you miss this opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.74,0:27:20.84,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,you may forever lose the chance to mend relations with the clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.00,0:27:45.30,Default,Silk2,0,0,0,,Yeonpyeong, I would like to be you in the next life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.73,0:27:48.77,Default,Spillik2,0,0,0,,"Find evidence." Sounds simple
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.77,0:27:51.41,Default,Spikyulka2,0,0,0,,and how much work it requires.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.32,0:28:00.78,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I see everyone is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.09,0:28:06.79,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I don’t think it’s appropriate
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.92,0:28:10.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,gathering in the kisaeng house when the king died.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.86,0:28:13.00,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I deliberately chose this place to relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.83,0:28:18.33,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,We can all be honest while we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.04,0:28:21.34,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Death of the King
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.01,0:28:25.27,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,we need to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.51,0:28:31.85,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Let's have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.18,0:28:35.89,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,The crowds of rebels are going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.15,0:28:38.65,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I am worried about the future of Joseon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.09,0:28:41.66,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,At this rate, Tonkhakovites
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.66,0:28:44.86,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,Khanyan will soon be captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.13,0:28:47.83,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,If this happens, everyone sitting here
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.16,0:28:49.87,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.03,0:28:54.60,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Therefore, we need to strengthen the security of the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.90,0:28:57.84,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,and the fortress walls around Khanyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:01.44,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,We will declare a state of emergency and restrict entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.81,0:29:04.05,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,All suspicious persons will be detained.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:07.85,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,So we will get rid of all the Tonhakites.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.19,0:29:14.09,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Brilliant idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.33,0:29:26.74,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,It seems the queen has lost her mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.84,0:29:29.81,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,She has always been like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.47,0:29:35.78,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,She thought that all the power was in her hands because of pregnancy,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.98,0:29:39.11,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,but the king died. I bet she's terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.65,0:29:43.25,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,If she gives birth to a prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.25,0:29:46.52,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,this will finish her off.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.26,0:29:50.36,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Finally, sensible words from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.64,0:30:07.81,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Candles and incense sticks need to be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.83,0:30:34.30,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I will die of a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.47,0:30:37.51,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Why are they guarding the dead man like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.41,0:30:41.34,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Isn’t there anything strange in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.15,0:30:45.35,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,We need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.25,0:30:49.65,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.14,0:31:09.34,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,He is badly wounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.11,0:31:12.17,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Especially the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.27,0:31:16.81,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,So strong that he is unrecognizable.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.34,0:31:42.07,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Eureka!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.92,0:31:55.45,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Hey rats, I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.45,0:31:57.82,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Everyone who deserves to be locked up says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.92,0:32:00.62,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,You are guilty of losing your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.82,0:32:04.66,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,How can you blame me for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.83,0:32:07.53,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,What idiot is capable of losing a weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.53,0:32:10.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Same as right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.23,0:32:12.97,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,The weapons depot was robbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.14,0:32:17.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I don’t think you’re interested,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.11,0:32:21.54,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,what Prince Yeonpyeong is guilty of.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.91,0:32:24.91,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. You're not here for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.05,0:32:27.05,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.85,0:32:31.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,What does this mean? Us
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.85,0:32:32.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,executed?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.96,0:32:36.13,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I can sit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.13,0:32:37.13,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I like to sleep on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.13,0:32:38.46,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.63,0:32:45.70,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.60,0:32:49.97,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Let's discuss. We can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.58,0:33:00.45,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Byonin sent Cheoljong to the rebels,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.45,0:33:02.35,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,using me as bait to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.65,0:33:06.82,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,But there’s someone else’s body there, which means
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.82,0:33:08.62,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,the plan did not work.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.13,0:33:14.96,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,He detained Cheoljong's people so that they would not help him return.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.90,0:33:25.47,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I can’t concentrate because of your sobbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.65,0:33:33.18,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Go closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.65,0:33:39.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I'll tell you a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.49,0:33:43.13,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,You must take him to your grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.13,0:33:49.46,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,King
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.83,0:33:53.00,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.87,0:33:56.91,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.11,0:34:02.28,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,His Majesty will live in your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.15,0:34:04.55,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Your...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.91,0:34:07.92,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I felt the body from head to toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.02,0:34:10.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,It’s not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.42,0:34:12.39,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,From head to toe?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.82,0:34:15.69,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I'll skip the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.36,0:34:21.06,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Lord.\N-If he is alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.73,0:34:24.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,why haven’t you returned yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.30,0:34:27.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,He is either wounded or tied up somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.14,0:34:30.47,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Lady Choi.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.64,0:34:32.98,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,There is a law prohibiting ascending the throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.98,0:34:35.08,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,immediately after the death of the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.54,0:34:38.28,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Yes. This custom is called Sanibok.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.28,0:34:42.15,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,You must wait for the return of the soul of the deceased within five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.15,0:34:44.59,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,The new king can ascend to the throne only in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.89,0:34:47.79,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Then we have six days, including the coronation day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.19,0:34:51.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,They will do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.23,0:34:53.30,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,so that during these six days the king does not return.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.20,0:34:56.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,How many maids are there in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.03,0:35:01.44,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,About 250 court maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.44,0:35:03.47,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,If you include court servants,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.47,0:35:05.51,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,will be more than 600.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.11,0:35:08.74,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,600 live surveillance cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.51,0:35:11.85,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,If each of them says a word, there will be 600 words.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.52,0:35:15.08,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Let's use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.05,0:35:17.09,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-What?\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.09,0:35:19.15,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I will disrupt the coronation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.29,0:35:22.56,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.06,0:35:24.06,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.46,0:35:26.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Yes.\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.83,0:35:28.93,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.23,0:35:32.10,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,If His Majesty is alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.37,0:35:38.07,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Our state is going through difficulties,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.47,0:35:40.48,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,the appointment of a new king cannot be delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.84,0:35:43.65,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,As a king performing royal duties,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.35,0:35:46.25,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I announce the 32nd descendant
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.25,0:35:48.82,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Prince Minheung, Lee Kyungwon.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.22,0:35:52.49,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,The king has left this world
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.26,0:35:54.96,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,due to the rebel uprising...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.39,0:35:56.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Tonghak followers who took away
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.86,0:35:59.16,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,the life of our king, do not deserve mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.63,0:36:01.53,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I declare that every single
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.53,0:36:04.33,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Tonghak followers will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.40,0:36:07.44,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,The Tonhakovians have brought trouble upon themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.44,0:36:08.80,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Scoundrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.38,0:36:19.38,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Benin.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.89,0:36:26.96,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Why did you delay
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.96,0:36:28.26,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Yeonpyeong and Hong?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:30.73,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,The balance of power is changing
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.73,0:36:32.26,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,depending on who is on the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.26,0:36:34.00,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,This is not the first time this has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.00,0:36:36.40,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,So be it. The king died just recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.40,0:36:38.30,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,How can you detain innocent people?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.73,0:36:40.34,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Innocent?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.20,0:36:44.17,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Being on the side of the weak is also a crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.34,0:36:48.08,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,Benin, how far are you willing to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.65,0:36:52.55,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I want to become more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.08,0:36:55.28,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,To protect those who are dear to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.12,0:36:58.85,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I need more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.73,0:37:07.10,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Make your lips lifeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.76,0:37:09.60,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,You are already a living corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.87,0:37:12.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Then make it look like a real corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.27,0:37:19.04,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Why go this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.71,0:37:22.94,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,The king has only me left.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.88,0:37:27.38,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Even if they want to get rid of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.38,0:37:29.68,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,they will not put a pregnant woman in a cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.49,0:37:33.72,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,What do I look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.56,0:37:39.76,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Like a real corpse.\N-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.51,0:38:02.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,The Dowager Queen has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.38,0:38:35.55,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,These two are going to put on quite a show here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.09,0:38:42.69,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Only the main prize will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.63,0:38:48.43,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.50,0:38:54.44,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,How could you leave me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.67,0:38:58.61,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,What about our child?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.11,0:39:01.14,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Your...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.61,0:39:06.01,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.55,0:39:13.32,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.46,0:39:14.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.89,0:39:17.66,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.93,0:39:21.06,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Call the royal physician. Urgently!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.60,0:39:26.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.23,0:39:28.17,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,If I’m delayed even for a little while, I’ll curse them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.17,0:39:29.24,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Drag, drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.24,0:39:32.87,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.11,0:39:36.55,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.92,0:39:43.42,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,How so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.69,0:39:46.72,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,How so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.26,0:39:49.49,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.82,0:39:54.10,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,How so.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.37,0:39:58.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Did you call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.54,0:40:02.17,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Were you horrified when you heard the news?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.34,0:40:05.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,What happened to him in the last days?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.78,0:40:09.38,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,How could he leave so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.71,0:40:12.81,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,King
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.59,0:40:17.72,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.59,0:40:21.02,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I called to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.23,0:40:28.33,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.70,0:40:31.40,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.27,0:40:37.37,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.67,0:40:40.31,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,This is just the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.78,0:40:49.62,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,We will calm the unrest in the country in four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.75,0:40:53.49,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Thanks to the king, we will get rid of the Tonhakites.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.89,0:40:56.79,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,The rest of the scum will defend themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.39,0:40:59.76,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Given what is happening, we can say,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.76,0:41:01.83,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,that he gave his life to save the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.10,0:41:08.57,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Until everything calms down,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.57,0:41:13.21,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,there are some concerns,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.41,0:41:16.38,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,that's why I gathered you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.71,0:41:20.62,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Andong Kims and Phunyang Chos
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.62,0:41:22.45,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,were at enmity for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.15,0:41:25.75,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,We united for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.75,0:41:27.69,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,to confront the common enemy - the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.96,0:41:29.86,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,But now the king has left the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.86,0:41:32.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,and I'm afraid that both clans will start to quarrel again
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.23,0:41:34.00,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,and compete with each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.20,0:41:36.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Before
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.33,0:41:39.20,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,let's move on to the agenda,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.04,0:41:41.97,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I prepared something to strengthen
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.97,0:41:43.64,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,union of two families.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.28,0:41:55.58,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Mutiny at court...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.55,0:42:00.82,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Move or overthrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.22,0:42:03.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,This means,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.73,0:42:06.09,Default,Lilia3,0,0,0,,that you are plotting treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.33,0:42:10.23,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,It is hidden in the depths of your souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.90,0:42:12.90,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,The king is dead anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.90,0:42:15.20,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,why leave such a document?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.20,0:42:17.61,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,In order to share responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.34,0:42:22.08,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,This will prevent any of the families from violating the terms of the alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.38,0:42:24.71,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I will leave evidence to emphasize that we are in the same boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.11,0:42:27.75,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,As long as you agree with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.35,0:42:31.92,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,I guarantee that two families can
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.99,0:42:34.96,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,coexist in power.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.49,0:42:36.79,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,This means,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.46,0:42:40.53,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,that you want to control our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.33,0:42:49.10,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,We can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.01,0:42:57.05,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,What are you allowing yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.05,0:42:58.81,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,How dare you gather soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.62,0:43:02.48,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,You must agree with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.99,0:43:06.05,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,to get out of here alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.10,0:43:15.53,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Kim Byunin
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.72,0:43:38.72,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.85,0:43:41.76,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,Yes. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.43,0:43:50.57,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Did you find out something?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.57,0:43:53.77,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,As you said, the palace gate
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.97,0:43:58.14,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,and all the gates around Hanyang are closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.17,0:44:00.24,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.14,0:44:02.31,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,What about the warriors?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.31,0:44:03.58,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,One spot left,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.58,0:44:05.35,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,where the warriors continue their search.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.05,0:44:07.82,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,This is next to the cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.62,0:44:11.75,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,I found you, Cheoljong. I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.32,0:44:18.99,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Something is making me sleepy. You need to go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.96,0:44:24.50,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,How I want to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.94,0:44:29.34,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I’m going to pass out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.34,0:44:31.57,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Good night, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.97,0:44:33.74,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Sweet dreams, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.21,0:44:36.34,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,Yes. Good night to you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.54,0:44:37.65,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.38,0:44:42.72,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,Be healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.49,0:44:45.65,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.92,0:44:49.39,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,When it comes to health, you shouldn’t be careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.73,0:44:52.99,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,-Yes, queen.\N-Yes, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.99,0:45:27.00,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Where is the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.03,0:45:29.10,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,She lost consciousness from shock,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.10,0:45:30.27,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,but quickly came to her senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.60,0:45:31.70,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Lost consciousness?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.94,0:45:39.37,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.52,0:45:56.02,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,That’s not what I’m thinking about, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.43,0:45:59.66,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Are you really ready to go that far?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.33,0:46:04.20,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,-Just move on.\N-You won’t leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.87,0:46:07.20,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,If you leave the palace, you will be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.27,0:46:08.70,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,You think I don’t know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.20,0:46:10.41,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.41,0:46:12.71,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,You used me as bait for the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.71,0:46:15.08,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,and it was you who pointed the sword at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.21,0:46:17.45,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.65,0:46:19.88,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,As long as you are safe,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.88,0:46:21.85,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,I am ready to put up with your hatred.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.15,0:46:24.05,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Be as mad at me as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.32,0:46:25.99,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,And give up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.42,0:46:28.26,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,The king is dead anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.26,0:46:30.79,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,No. He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.79,0:46:34.30,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,You know, the king is not one of those who will die easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.66,0:46:37.07,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Isn’t that why you are in such a hurry with the coronation?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.07,0:46:38.17,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.37,0:46:40.37,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.07,0:46:44.51,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,You must turn your back on the king to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.68,0:46:49.51,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,You wanted to know why I chose the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.61,0:46:52.58,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I'll answer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.18,0:46:55.25,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,If anyone deserves to become king,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.62,0:46:57.52,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,then only His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.32,0:47:00.49,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,He is the most suitable candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.12,0:47:04.86,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,So don’t even try to make a choice for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.86,0:47:05.99,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,If you continue,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.63,0:47:14.20,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,you won’t leave me a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.94,0:47:18.94,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Soyeon, how can you point an arrow at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.17,0:47:20.64,Default,shooting4,0,0,0,,You know my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.88,0:47:24.11,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,If you loved her so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.81,0:47:26.88,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,shouldn’t I have understood,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.88,0:47:28.72,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,that Kim So-yeon has changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.39,0:47:32.42,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.69,0:47:35.69,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,, Am I really the woman you've been dreaming about all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.69,0:47:38.23,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,I'm a completely different person inside, but you didn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.76,0:47:40.06,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,The one you loved, -
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.20,0:47:42.83,Default,shooting4,0,0,0,,just a shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.86,0:47:44.80,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,-Soyeon.\N-The real Soyeon, whom you loved,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.80,0:47:46.17,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.44,0:47:49.44,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.74,0:47:57.25,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,The real Soyeon couldn't shoot you,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.91,0:47:59.98,Default,tira4,0,0,0,,because I loved you like a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.12,0:48:02.42,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,But I’m different.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.02,0:48:07.12,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I can shoot at you as much as I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.77,0:48:20.10,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I warned you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.67,0:48:23.37,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,I didn’t want to hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.95,0:49:04.98,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.35,0:49:08.92,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,It was so obvious that we decided it was a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.42,0:49:11.52,Default,shooting room4,0,0,0,,I came because I want to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.82,0:49:15.06,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,When I don’t see you, I feel like I’m going to die of anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.96,0:49:18.43,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Forget and come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.69,0:49:20.90,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,No, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.00,0:49:23.36,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,If you want to go alone, you’ll have to step on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.91,0:49:34.51,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Four days left.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.94,0:49:38.68,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Coronation in four days.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.68,0:49:40.95,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,How do you search an entire forest
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.95,0:49:43.05,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,and will you find the king alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.92,0:49:47.16,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Are you grinning now?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.39,0:49:48.59,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.02,0:49:50.93,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,There are many wild animals in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.93,0:49:52.63,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,You won't last long there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.86,0:49:54.60,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Wolves can eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.30,0:49:57.97,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Or the warriors may find your frozen body.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.70,0:50:02.47,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,How so. So scary! I'm literally shaking with fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.47,0:50:04.01,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Say what you want: don’t scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.17,0:50:06.21,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.41,0:50:08.58,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Since the queen does not want us to go with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.58,0:50:11.48,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,we will be punished for not being able to stop her,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.71,0:50:14.52,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,will force us to drink the cup of poison,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.28,0:50:17.85,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,and we will fall into eternal sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.33,0:50:34.30,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Okay. You can come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.11,0:50:39.37,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,This is not a vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.37,0:50:40.41,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,why do you need it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.74,0:50:43.08,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,How will you pass the fortress in Hanyang?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.21,0:50:47.22,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I thought I could just jump over the wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.22,0:50:49.15,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,but now because of you it won’t work out that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.22,0:50:53.59,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,The fortress in Hanyang is very high, how would you jump over it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.19,0:50:56.52,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Are you laughing at me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.36,0:51:01.43,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,We've already taken care of everything. You have nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.85,0:51:16.08,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.37,0:51:26.91,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I thought we were going to celebrate,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.41,0:51:29.51,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,but judging by your face, you are washing down defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.68,0:51:31.51,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,What wound can you heal like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.97,0:51:33.47,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Where did you get hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.72,0:51:38.49,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Touch my cup again,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.95,0:51:41.49,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,and I will cut off your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.36,0:51:48.43,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,If you loved her so much,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.82,0:51:50.66,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,shouldn’t I have understood,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.89,0:51:52.74,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,that Kim So-yeon has changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.37,0:51:56.26,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Last night he looked exactly like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.91,0:52:01.37,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,What? Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.20,0:52:03.70,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,What an abomination!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.18,0:52:05.55,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I’m already confused,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.55,0:52:06.91,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,and you’re talking about love here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.91,0:52:31.11,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.70,0:52:34.34,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Go to your room and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.70,0:52:37.14,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,The stove is on, so it will be warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.55,0:52:40.22,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Why don’t you ask anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.09,0:52:42.78,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Because I am a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.03,0:52:54.93,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,What did they do?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.93,0:52:57.70,Default,shooting4,0,0,0,,Letter with a plan for treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.09,0:53:00.87,Default,shooting4,0,0,0,,Without my knowledge? It's very risky.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.87,0:53:02.91,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,As soon as we get it, it will become our weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.91,0:53:04.24,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.64,0:53:06.43,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I'll bring it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.74,0:53:08.05,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,You are accused of treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.05,0:53:10.41,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,If you return immediately after the king disappears,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.87,0:53:13.24,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,this will be suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.72,0:53:15.59,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I don’t want to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.24,0:53:18.01,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I will be happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.86,0:53:22.28,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,if I can continue to help you from the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.62,0:53:29.12,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,By the way, I heard that the queen left the palace at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.97,0:53:32.39,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,How dare she run away in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.66,0:53:35.61,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,I didn’t tell anyone about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.91,0:53:37.30,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,but you already know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.47,0:53:40.24,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Knowing what a queen can be,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.70,0:53:42.91,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,I don’t think she just ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.68,0:53:44.82,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Why then?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.84,0:53:49.51,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I'm sure she wants to find the king to return everything to its place.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.34,0:53:54.68,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,She must be sure that the king is alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.62,0:53:59.30,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,She must have a reason to believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.30,0:54:02.07,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,She took off her dress and left the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.07,0:54:03.30,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,which means
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.49,0:54:07.03,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,now she's just an ordinary woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.30,0:54:09.20,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Even knowing that she is lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.20,0:54:12.11,Default,tira4,0,0,0,,I tried to accept her for the sake of Byonin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.53,0:54:15.97,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,The royal couple seems to love each other very much,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.74,0:54:20.34,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,so why don't we bury them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.49,0:54:24.51,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Take care of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.57,0:54:37.59,Default,shooting4,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.97,0:54:40.87,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,I have returned to help the Dowager Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.37,0:54:46.11,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,Are these the ones responsible for the death of the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.74,0:54:47.80,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.80,0:54:49.68,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,We are just collecting herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.84,0:54:52.34,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,We have never met the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.24,0:54:56.34,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,It turns out, such rootless creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.72,0:54:59.01,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,caught a dragon without even realizing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.32,0:55:27.59,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,You jumped up so sharply, apparently everything is fine with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.14,0:55:29.55,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I thought you were already dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.01,0:55:31.05,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.05,0:55:33.59,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,What do you think? Herbalist, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.72,0:55:35.66,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Why else would I live in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.43,0:55:38.99,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Are you the one who saved me?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.86,0:55:43.32,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Not really. Let's just say I found you and brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.62,0:55:45.24,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,You were wearing expensive clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.24,0:55:47.16,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,so I thought you
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.16,0:55:49.01,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,repay me for saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.01,0:55:50.43,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,You have to pay for everything, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.78,0:55:53.37,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,But you have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.74,0:55:56.11,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,The fabric looked expensive,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.11,0:55:58.82,Default,tier4,0,0,0,,but I couldn’t sell this rag.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.18,0:56:01.49,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I just burned everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.78,0:56:03.78,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Burn?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.78,0:56:07.49,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,There are warriors walking everywhere and looking for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.45,0:56:11.93,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Am I wrong in bringing you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.43,0:56:14.47,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Collector!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.20,0:56:18.26,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,If you run away without paying,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.26,0:56:20.09,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I will cut off your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.74,0:56:22.84,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,Remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.72,0:56:36.41,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,I brought you the best ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.47,0:56:55.47,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,So, so, and what next?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.47,0:56:58.18,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,So, during the funeral they use someone else's corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.18,0:57:00.74,Default,tyra4,0,0,0,,If they can hold a coronation within 6 days,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.55,0:57:02.57,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.55,0:57:05.12,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,How did you know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.12,0:57:07.34,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,These idiots are so predictable!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.09,0:57:10.84,Default,shooting gallery4,0,0,0,,These idiots deserve punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.80,0:57:25.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This is the confession of a follower of Tonhak.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.24,0:57:28.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I already have an idea of ​​who to blame for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.07,0:57:30.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Find the right moment after the coronation,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.70,0:57:32.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,to announce this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.24,0:57:35.24,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.82,0:57:40.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Can I ask you to look after the palace guards for now?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.74,0:57:42.89,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.14,0:57:45.41,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,I want it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.18,0:57:49.95,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,bring the heads of the king and queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.99,0:58:00.26,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,3 days before the coronation
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.30,0:58:03.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Benin!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.07,0:58:08.05,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Are you going in search of the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.07,0:58:11.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why did she leave the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.28,0:58:14.14,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You should know the reason, you are so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.95,0:58:18.51,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,The Queen is no longer the Soyeon I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.41,0:58:20.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.20,0:58:41.64,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I must return the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.64,0:58:45.22,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Some kind of flimsy lock. Maybe I can open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.28,0:58:54.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,There must be a second constipation somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.39,0:58:55.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you opened it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.78,0:58:56.95,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.39,0:59:04.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Prince Yeonpyeong, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.34,0:59:07.80,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.20,0:59:10.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You know, I’m friends with everyone in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.30,0:59:14.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You were locked here only because you are friends of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.68,0:59:16.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Don’t worry about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.24,0:59:19.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I will get you out, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.87,0:59:21.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You are a true friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.24,0:59:25.66,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your devotion is unwavering even in such a precarious situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.51,0:59:27.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.22,0:59:31.05,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You made friends with me not because I’m from the Andonian Kims.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.55,0:59:34.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And I became friends with you not because you are a close friend of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.89,0:59:38.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Exactly.\N-The thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.24,0:59:40.49,Default,Spikyulka,0,0,0,,that now there is complete chaos in the palace,\N and beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.97,0:59:43.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,They want to pin the murder of the king on the followers of Tonhak.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.57,0:59:46.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I'm afraid innocent people will suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.43,0:59:48.51,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Even the queen
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.57,0:59:52.34,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,suddenly disappeared in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.32,0:59:57.76,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,What do you mean the queen has disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.76,1:00:00.49,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,She disappeared from the palace
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.12,1:00:03.36,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,together with the court lady and the maid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.95,1:00:06.39,Default,Biryulka,0,0,0,,Benin just left the palace
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.39,1:00:08.66,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,to search for her,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.80,1:00:11.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,but his appearance bothered me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.99,1:00:13.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Why did you bother?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.24,1:00:15.41,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm making it up,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.24,1:00:17.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,but he looked like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.30,1:00:20.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,as if he wanted to tear her to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.57,1:00:28.62,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Mommies.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.05,1:00:34.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What? For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.39,1:00:36.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.57,1:00:42.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Now everything is in order.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.89,1:00:44.97,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.97,1:00:47.57,Default,Spillikins,0,0,0,,What was that, Lady Choi? You scared me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.01,1:00:51.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You always need to be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.03,1:00:54.18,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.64,1:00:58.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You are always careful. Pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.24,1:01:00.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Go, move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.34,1:01:02.45,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Let me help.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.91,1:01:05.76,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.05,1:01:09.45,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Wow, I can’t believe you brought so much with you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.78,1:01:10.86,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.43,1:01:13.03,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Candied bell root.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.36,1:01:14.59,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Candied bell root?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.59,1:01:17.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I received them from someone special and treasured them very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.49,1:01:19.87,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You can take it, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.07,1:01:21.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Then I’ll try one.\N-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.41,1:01:26.93,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,It’s a miracle how delicious it is. Try one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.93,1:01:28.11,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hon Young, and you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.61,1:01:30.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Well, okay.\N-Here, you try it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.30,1:01:31.32,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.34,1:01:33.47,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,This is so delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.39,1:01:41.09,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi! How so?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.09,1:01:42.45,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-I'm fine.\N-Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.30,1:01:46.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes, everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.49,1:01:49.57,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,God, I'm completely fine, queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.99,1:01:51.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Move on.\N-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.07,1:01:56.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Where is the king?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.74,1:02:00.84,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you were raised like a delicate flower.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.84,1:02:02.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Are you really comfortable sleeping like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.20,1:02:04.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Yes. I've done this many times.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.22,1:02:07.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Really? You?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.09,1:02:09.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Even I have never had to.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.91,1:02:11.91,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Drop it. This is nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.91,1:02:14.01,Default,Biryulka,0,0,0,,Have you done a forced march of 400 km with a load of 50 kg?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.68,1:02:15.78,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,400 kilometers?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.09,1:02:22.32,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What a dreamer. 400 km? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.49,1:02:25.43,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Well, yes, I exaggerated a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.43,1:02:26.74,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,But it’s definitely passed 200.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.74,1:02:29.11,Default,Spikilka,0,0,0,,During winter operations we melted ice and drank...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.57,1:02:33.61,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Well, yes, well, yes. We believe, we believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.80,1:02:37.20,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm completely serious!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.20,1:02:39.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Of course, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.51,1:02:41.24,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,I don’t want you to catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.78,1:02:44.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,We can’t even make a fire without being captured.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.51,1:02:47.95,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I’m worried about how we’ll sleep on such a cold night.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.76,1:02:50.78,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It’s a pity that you’re going through this, queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.43,1:02:53.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,This is nonsense. And it's not cold at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.45,1:02:55.47,Default,Spilyk,0,0,0,,Nothing compares to our winter operations.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.20,1:02:59.39,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.49,1:03:28.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Turn off the air conditioner, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.39,1:03:31.76,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,I might catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.53,1:04:31.66,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,We didn’t find her.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.45,1:04:34.49,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Split into groups and comb the entire mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.72,1:04:35.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Yes!\N-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.86,1:05:01.09,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,For some reason I have a good feeling today.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.86,1:05:05.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,With this sunshine, I believe that today we will find the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.47,1:05:18.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-We don’t have time for this. Go ahead.\N-Yes, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.11,1:05:21.24,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Let's hurry.\N-We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.95,1:05:24.91,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Is this the road?\N-Yes, queen. Let's move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.01,1:05:30.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,We are almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.34,1:05:32.76,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Soon we will reach the cliff.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.12,1:05:35.68,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,It’s you who are so confident in your 20s.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.26,1:05:37.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,The energy is rushing!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.09,1:05:41.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Let's take a short break.\N-Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.01,1:05:53.93,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I must say, the world is brighter now,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.68,1:05:57.45,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,when we are outside the palace, queen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.74,1:06:02.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And before she hated leaving the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.28,1:06:03.28,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.05,1:06:06.05,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,And you, Hong Young?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.26,1:06:07.99,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Which do you prefer?\NThe palace or outside it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.86,1:06:10.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Where you are, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.28,1:06:13.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-That’s what she said.\N-Hey, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.14,1:06:20.07,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Queen, they are here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.66,1:06:23.16,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Here they are. Grab them!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.16,1:06:24.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Run, you need to hide!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.51,1:06:25.70,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-Okay.\N-Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.57,1:06:30.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hon Young, accompany the queen. Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.07,1:06:33.28,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Lady Choi, where are you going? Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.01,1:06:36.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Don’t you dare, geeks! I won't allow it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.72,1:06:38.12,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, we must run.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.45,1:06:40.62,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Court Lady Choi!\N-I won’t let you in!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.62,1:06:41.78,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.36,1:06:44.53,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.55,1:06:48.57,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.76,1:06:51.37,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Back!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.95,1:07:06.24,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Court lady Choi!\N-Queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.74,1:07:07.84,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.84,1:07:10.84,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Take them!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.18,1:07:12.59,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I beg you, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.38,1:07:16.96,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,No! No need.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.96,1:07:20.20,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Lady Choi!\N-Queen! Please...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.92,1:07:24.50,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,-Lady Choi!\N-No. No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.33,1:07:30.33,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,-No! Court Lady Choi!\N-We must escape, queen!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.63,1:07:31.88,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.28,1:07:35.34,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.71,1:07:39.92,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Run! Queen, I beg you, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.83,1:07:52.72,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, I hope you find the king.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.17,1:07:58.33,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Hon Young!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.26,1:08:00.33,Default,Spillie,0,0,0,,Follow her!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.21,1:09:23.51,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.25,1:09:28.08,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,What did you do with Soyeon?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.63,1:09:47.91,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,How I became a queen
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.86,1:10:10.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,You said you know everything about me and Soyeon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.59,1:10:13.00,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Suddenly they came back to me
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.17,1:10:14.29,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,all her memories.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.50,1:10:21.30,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Soyeon still lives inside you if her memories are preserved.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.50,1:10:24.00,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Hold my hand until you get out unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.00,1:10:27.01,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,I knew it. You only think about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.54,1:10:30.62,Default,Spillik,0,0,0,,Take them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.68,1:10:32.92,Default,Spillit,0,0,0,,Follow the queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.67,0:15:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,0:39:42.84,0:39:43.84,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Okay.
Comment: 0,0:41:02.82,0:41:04.22,Default,Lily3,0,0,0,,Displacement or overthrow of the king
